## CURRENT-INVENTORY PROJECTION — parser-visible formula

The following is the selected **Ambrette-Orris Velvet** candidate. It uses one
precise musk and avoids carrier-unresolved Orris Liquid, Vanillin, Heliotropin,
Liffarome, held Ambrofix liquid, Bacdanol, approximate Coumarin stock, depleted
musks, and unneeded leather/oud materials. Stock fractions are carried into
nominal active µL and volume-basis ppm. A w/w stock does not become measured
active volume without density; these are repository screening values, not
exact mass ppm. The selected 1,800 µL raw Ambrettolide stock is large because
the owned material is only 10%; its unresolved fraction basis and correspondingly
large DPG burden are explicit current-build liabilities, not luxury or similarity.

